<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viad, TriMas cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viad, TriMas cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Donald Zwyer downgraded Viad Corp and TriMas Corp to hold from buy due to the stocks' valuations.</p>
<p>-- Viad was off 1/16 to 18-15/16.</p>
<p>-- TriMas fell 3/16 to 28-15/16.</p>
